# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, OR set these in your
# hosting platform (Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables).
#
# IMPORTANT: this is read at BUILD TIME by src/api.ts. If it is unset the
# frontend falls back to http://localhost:8000/api/v1, which will not work
# once the site is hosted.

# Full base URL of the deployed backend API, e.g. your Render service.
# Must match the backend's FRONTEND_ORIGIN/CORS setting (minus /api/v1).
VITE_API_URL=https://your-render-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
